        "description": {
          "en-US": "Railbird turns your phone into an intelligent companion for pool.\n\nRecord matches, keep score, review individual shots, and use detailed analysis\nto understand your game. Railbird's camera workflow is designed for the pool\ntable, making it easy to capture sessions and revisit the moments that matter.\n\nAn account and access to Railbird's hosted services are required for core\nfeatures.\n"
